d", "head": [35934, 36008], "body": [36086, 36697], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62nrk2", "n": 31, "items": 2, "chars": 137, "words": 28, "title": "The moderators are all heathens!", "head": [36775, 36862], "body": [36940, 37219], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62nse7", "n": 32, "items": 2, "chars": 325, "words": 58, "title": "Box bretheren, we of the lattice hereby pledge allegiance", "head": [37297, 37409], "body": [37487, 37905], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62nsvk", "n": 33, "items": 3, "chars": 278, "words": 24, "title": "Do we have a real-time way to communicate?", "head": [37983, 38080], "body": [38158, 38581], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62nx9b", "n": 34, "items": 2, "chars": 107, "words": 19, "title": "Green's greatest hope. This is where we make our stand.", "head": [38659, 38769], "body": [38847, 39102], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62nzen", "n": 35, "items": 8, "chars": 761, "words": 137, "title": "Dominant Pattern", "head": [39180, 39869], "body": [39947, 41128], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "62o484", "n": 36, "items": 2, "chars": 118, "words": 22, "title": "Vote on where we should dedicate our forces", "head": [41206, 41304], "body": [41382, 41650], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62o48m", "n": 37, "items": 1, "chars": 23, "words": 4, "title": "Together we shall grow!", "head": [41728, 41804], "body": [41882, 41950], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62oaf9", "n": 38, "items": 3, "chars": 123, "words": 20, "title": "Please don't destroy my smiley face. Smiley faces make people stop feeling blue, after all.", "head": [42028, 42174], "body": [42252, 42516], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62oaq0", "n": 39, "items": 1, "chars": 67, "words": 12, "title": "So wait, are we in the corner or continuing the pattern?", "head": [42594, 42704], "body": [42782, 42898], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "62od0v", "n": 40, "items": 4, "chars": 304, "words": 57, "title": "We have successfully taken the bottom left corner. Now we expand!", "head": [42976, 43096], "body